                                    "kind": "turn",
                                    "title": "Turn 45: write alignment_review.md",
                                    "status": "ok",
                                    "ms": 37736,
                                    "note": "Запишу поэлементный обзор: все 35 рамок проверены, отличие декоративной A и ограничения адаптации отмечены явно.\n\nWrote alignment_review.md (8613 characters).\n\n--- written ---\n# Alignment review\n\n<!-- image-to-ui-review-binding: structure=ba5f781c3eacefbcc98283539d592f295abe4f241500b7ccc49415155f7c155f artifacts=8156fd808568c2918547958ef262d81f8397ac1d1cb1a44a8bf11208448cdf8c -->\n\nNative canvas: Screen, 1179×2112. Reviewed the source region by region, current comparison, all-element overlay, and focused risk sheet. All 35 legend paths are accounted for below. The root is the structural full-canvas container and is not enumerated by the legend. No native elements were skipped.\n\nKit artwork is deliberately retained rather than replaced by screenshot cuts or generated shapes. Decorative A is an accepted te",
